  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA of size NNN.\n\nYour task is to determine the **minimum** number of elements that need to be removed from the array AAA such that the bitwise OR of the remaining elements is 2x−12^x - 12x−1 for some integer x&nbsp;(x≥0)x \\ (x\\geq 0)x&nbsp;(x≥0).\n\nNote that the bitwise OR of an empty array is considered to be 000.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nThe first line of each test case contains an integer NNN - the size of the array AAA.\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1,A_2,\\ldots,A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​, denoting the array AAA.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line, the **minimum** number of elements that need to be removed from the array.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "0≤Ai≤1090 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^90≤Ai​≤109",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases won't exceed 3⋅1053 \\cdot 10^53⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n2\n6 16\n5\n1 17 18 5 6",
        "output": "2\n2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111:\n\nIf we don't remove any element then bitwise OR will be 222222 which is not of the form 2x−12^x - 12x−1.\nIf we remove 666, then bitwise OR will be 161616 which is not of the form 2x−12^x - 12x−1. Similarly, if we remove 161616 then bitwise OR will be 666 which is not of the form 2x−12^x - 12x−1.\nIf we remove both elements then bitwise OR is 000 which is of the form 2x−12^x - 12x−1 for x=0x = 0x=0.\n\nTest case 222: If we remove A2=17A_2=17A2​=17 and A3=18A_3=18A3​=18, then bitwise OR of remaining elements will be 777 which is of the form 2x−12^x - 12x−1 for x=3x = 3x=3.\nIt can be shown that we cannot satisfy the condition by removing less than 222 elements."
      }
    ]
  },
